  "question": {
    "text": "A semicircular disc of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> and radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is free to rotate about its diameter. The moment of inertia of semicircular disc about a line perpendicular to its plane through centre is",
